{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/AzeFYAIemx3VH8VoNlq9Jw","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:18.049160+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/AzeFYAIemx3VH8VoNlq9Jw","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/cibtkkxeicIalAib8T8Yt5Yo7RTtkV9Csxiajbfrp5ROYOEGicOGBtxHXia5QDWPuNt7WRVgLlKEubFFqkTibO0jK9Z5Hpfuz2ibf6ob9LyItX9QhLA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/cibtkkxeicIamUKTvjuR9xMibucQWpXic84Wc1qicOpn1kJMhDEPiahUqUl9icGgEGzibBxEamtLSgEtHaVgbWR88nmDR8UKDKJnqHuJutylsoKAE8g/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>关于我们  </span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/cibtkkxeicIalrtzE7O3x7WDy0kjvFCfVn0sPQN0E0egAXG0URUgeWSpxolhTt7dRdgynmX7JsKLDliaTpf0SR8esOX2XKpptXOmCLTlWBemQg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>复旦大学类脑智能科学与技术研究院（以下简称：类脑院）成立于2015年6月，是国内高校最早成立的脑科学与类脑前沿交叉研究机构之一。旨在面向脑与类脑重大科技前沿和国家重大需求，依托复旦大学数学、神经科学、生物医学工程、临床医学、计算机、智能科学与技术等多学科优势，凝聚国内外科研实力，组建交叉研究团队，开展认知神经科学、计算生物学、计算精神病学、人工智能算法、类脑智能技术与转化等前沿基础和应用研究，建成世界一流的脑与类脑前沿研究和科技创新机构。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>类脑院设有生物医学工程、应用数学、智能科学与技术学术学位；电子信息、生物与医药专业学位；依托复旦大学大数据学院招收应用统计人工智能方向专业硕士。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>01</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名时间</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>即日起-8月10日17：00</span></p></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>02</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名条件</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>1.全国各高等学校2027年应届本科毕业生。</span></p><p><span>2.学习成绩优秀，本科前3年或前5学期总评成绩排名在该校同年级相关专业（数学、物理、信息、计算机、生物医学工程、神经科学等）前20%之内（在科研方面有突出表现的学生可不受此约束），并能达到所在高校推荐免试资格要求。</span></p><p><span>3. 有志于从事智能科学与技术、类脑智能等相关交叉学科的研究工作，具有一定的学术科研能力或潜力。</span></p></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>03</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名材料</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>1.近期正面免冠彩色证件照片，电子版JPG格式，150*200像素，大小500k以内。</span></p><p><span>2.本科阶段历年成绩单（须加盖教务处或院系公章），JPG或PDF格式。</span></p><p><span>3.本科阶段前3年或前5学期总评成绩排名（模板下载链接：https://istbi.fudan.edu.cn/jx/xzzq.htm）</span></p><p><span>4.外语水平证明，如CET4、CET6、雅思、托福、专业外语成绩等。</span></p><p><span>5.有关获奖证书和学术科研成果，如发表论文、出版物或其他原创性工作。</span></p><p><span>6.《考生诚信考核承诺书》（从报考服务系统上下载，手写签名后上传）。</span></p><p><span>7.个人自述。包括个人简历，本科期间学习、科研、实践工作简介，对读研期间学习和未来职业规划的初步设想，1000字左右。</span></p><p><span>8.个人简历（模板下载链接：同上，如提交的个人简历不符合我单位要求，视为此项材料不合格）</span></p><p><span>9.请各位同学在系统提交完上述材料后，将所有材料合成为一个pdf发送至类脑院招生邮箱（istbi_zs@fudan.edu.cn）</span></p></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>04</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>遴选结果通知</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>进入复试结果将通过复旦大学研究生报考服务系统发布，请考生及时登录查看，暂定于8月20日左右在类脑院官方网站公布进入复试名单。</span></p></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>05</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>活动安排</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>复试将线下举行，具体活动安排将另行通知</span></p></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>06</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>相关说明</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>1.本次推免招生活动招收直博生，此外，类脑院依托大数据学院招收“025200应用统计-人工智能方向”专业学位硕士生，请有意向申请类脑院专业学位硕士研究生的考生在研究生报考服务系统报名时选择：098大数据学院-025200应用统计专业-03人工智能（类脑研究院）方向。该方向由大数据学院统一进行笔试，面试由类脑院组织。详情参见复旦大学研究生报考服务系统中各院系的报考须知。</span></p><p><span>2.暑期咨询方式：邮件咨询：istbi_zs@fudan.edu.cn</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>ISTBI</span></strong></p></section></section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>ISTBI</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/cibtkkxeicIamQepkA6AyQsxqcuCzRn9BYto5BQnJ6t1SHxvun98tlK7SsImibMPicJ7xj2Ley7EtK3WOpBVHiaH9LtWDibKCURuduiaSiajWplqWSU/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>扫描二维码</span></strong><strong><span>关注我们</span></strong></p><p><span>复旦大学</span></p><p><span>类脑智能科学与技术研究院</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"2c170e15be115fc3a05ce62bbd57580007ac84e22597fbe34e3e2b973be86f0f","textLength":1276,"sourceSha256":"1d99e839a1a01c08bb15c9160c3688cff0c4bbea56f31ab616c9367fdec0cfa4","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-692bd53a1f602cd9214d","title":"2026年复旦大学类脑智能科学与技术研究院2027级推免生招生预报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:18.049160+00:00"}
